post.description:
Create a new compound with its ingredient/child compound calculations in one atomic transaction.

**How it works:**
- Create the compound first
- Then create all ingredient calculations (price from invoice_detail)
- Then create all child compound calculations (price from child compound's price)
- If any calculation fails, everything is rolled back (compound won't be created)
- Compound price is auto-calculated as sum of all calculation total_costs

**Example Request:**
```json
{
"compound": { "name": "Pizza Dough", "quantity": 1, "measurement": "kg" },
"ingredient_calculations": [
{ "ingredient_id": "flour-uuid", "quantity": "0.5" },
{ "ingredient_id": "water-uuid", "quantity": "0.3" }
],
"compound_calculations": [
{ "compound_id": "yeast-mix-uuid", "quantity": "1" }
]
}
```

Create a new good/menu item with its ingredient/compound calculations in one atomic transaction.

**How it works:**
- Create the good first
- Then create all ingredient calculations (price from invoice_detail)
- Then create all compound calculations (price from compound.price)
- If any calculation fails, everything is rolled back (good won't be created)

**Example Request:**
```json
{
"good": { "name": "Osh", "price": "85000.00" },
"ingredient_calculations": [
{ "ingredient_id": "sabzi-uuid", "quantity": "2.5" },
{ "ingredient_id": "guruch-uuid", "quantity": "0.5" }
],
"compound_calculations": [
{ "compound_id": "salad-uuid", "quantity": "3" },
{ "compound_id": "xamir-uuid", "quantity": "1" }
]
}
```
